      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pr-community-section" aria-labelledby="pr-community-title">
      <div class="pr-shell">
        <div class="pr-community pr-reveal">
          <div class="pr-community__mark"><img src="/assets/images/creator-tf.webp" alt="" width="481" height="512" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
          <div class="pr-community__copy"><p class="pr-overline">05 / BUILT BY TANZIMFC</p><h2 id="pr-community-title">Made by a player.<br /><em>For the whole community.</em></h2><p>FCMOBILETOOLS grows around the real questions players ask. Use the tools, join the conversation, and help shape what gets built next.</p></div>
          <div class="pr-community__links"><a class="pr-button pr-button--primary" href="https://discord.com/invite/B4a7AxuU69" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span set:html={svg('discord')} />Join Discord <span set:html={svg('arrow')} /></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@tanzimfc" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span set:html={svg('youtube')} />Watch TanzimFC <span>↗</span></a><a href="/leagues/"><span set:html={svg('users')} />Find your league <span>↗</span></a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pr-section pr-faq-section" aria-labelledby="pr-faq-title">
      <div class="pr-shell pr-faq-layout">
        <div class="pr-faq-intro pr-reveal"><p class="pr-overline">06 / QUICK ANSWERS</p><h2 id="pr-faq-title">Need one thing?<br /><em>Start here.</em></h2><p>Clear answers about the tools, codes and reset schedule—without sending you through another page first.</p><a class="pr-text-link" href="/legal/about">About FCMOBILETOOLS <span>↗</span></a></div>
        <div class="pr-faq-list pr-reveal">
